00:13:49,014 --> 00:14:09,822
6. Multi-Dimensional Arrays (2001). Packed (left): [7:0] — contiguous bits, can be used as a single vector. Unpacked (right): [0:255] — array of elements; select with one index at a time in 2001. Declaration and Usage

